        "id": 1836438
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-03-18T18:11:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Make this a match instead. Avoid adding returns outside the top of the function (guard statements) and the end of the function.\n\n```\nmatch (cur_a2dp_cap, cur_hfp_cap) {\n  (Some(cap), Some(hfp_cap)) \u003d\u003e ...,\n  (_, _) \u003d\u003e {\n    ...\n  }\n}\n```",
      "revId": "1c5d25c86dfd999cbff5591d795f591109d0d0f5",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
