      "message": "Looks weird to me seeing this passes a \"clone\" of hash set every time.\n\nCould that cause problem that one success `check_and_send` modifies the \"device_added\" map but the later `check_and_send` doesn\u0027t get the expected result because they own independent copy of original \"device_added\"?",
