      "message": "devices_added is Arc\u003cMutex\u003cHashSet\u003e\u003e so the clone is occurring on Arc\u003cT\u003e. The clone simply increases the refcount on Arc and the shared data is protected by the mutex.\n\nThis is WAI.",
